41	 * person's last statement keeps the figure it had then, and settling it fixes that figure. A claim
42	 * belongs to the period its due-by falls in (fixed at creation: an edit, re-date or move leaves it).
43	 * No claim due inside a closed period can be added, edited or change status. No
44	 * claim can be added or edited to a date after its person's retirement date, nor after the from-date
45	 * and before the to-date of one of their past retirements. A clerk settles a claim
46	 * only when its figure is at or below the sheet's clerk limit (a claim with no figure is within any
47	 * limit); a clerk settling one above it makes it PENDING instead. A steward settles any claim, and
